<http://data.silknow.org/object/7ef6df92-bd9e-366a-b11d-05e41fa2656e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Table frontal, tapestry weave (kesi), China, 18th-19th century"@en , "Table frontal woven in coloured silks, gold thread and fine graments of peacocks' feathers. It is divided by a horizontal band of scrolled clouds into two unequal parts. In teh narrow part, above, is a pair of four-clawed dragons pursuing a flaming pearl, above a line of sea-weaves strewn with symbols. The space below has a large medallion in the middle encircling five stylised dragons of archaically scrolled outline. This is surrounded by scrolled clous, in the midst of which a pair of phoenixes is flying; underneath the phonixes are two <i>qilins</i>, and at the bottom a lien of sea waves.\n\nDensity 16x20 threads/sq.cm."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0101d73f-099b-3a21-925b-b55f5a17e0d1> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/17a36983-c175-3fcf-8172-747f82319cdf> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/9a38e661-0093-38bf-8e84-e86dcb03e1f7> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Table frontal woven in coloured silks, gold thread and fine graments of peacocks' feathers. It is divided by a horizontal band of scrolled clouds into two unequal parts. In teh narrow part, above, is a pair of four-clawed dragons pursuing a flaming pearl, above a line of sea-weaves strewn with symbols. The space below has a large medallion in the middle encircling five stylised dragons of archaically scrolled outline. This is surrounded by scrolled clous, in the midst of which a pair of phoenixes is flying; underneath the phonixes are two <i>qilins</i>, and at the bottom a lien of sea waves.\n\nDensity 16x20 threads/sq.cm."@en , "Table frontal, tapestry weave (kesi), China, 18th-19th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/7ef6df92-bd9e-366a-b11d-05e41fa2656e/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7ef6df92-bd9e-366a-b11d-05e41fa2656e/dimension/1> ;
